10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ghm13GL5JoIQ7kNvwHu2B8O&_nc_oc=AdrNvtMgjgjihi9LraSyUh2e1F9QlwuE8L69CAYKkpYSPMD3fv2MYacGgXY1_tfs32A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GI3mXYeicq2_xFXvpt_RMbcLcXYnQu3drTF_TuOb93g&oe=6A05DB4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nuhm6HILGicQ7kNvwERGDuu&_nc_oc=AdqfKn-mNL-6PKK39KDAdujF7eqGvU_DNjNqV1dvB9H8YiBZcO6gnd_uHK9ralMcN1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5260JHxhjxg7AK5LZsGLPx4UrvKbjgCjk2ANFRoF1y5A&oe=6A05EC3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WSXSbZA58fwQ7kNvwF_Vy2D&_nc_oc=Adozm4vfS3K78kY26IHTQ3XRlIx1J-lqyfU6DymojAarb31QfpxwQ8grNBB4U62nNg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xypn6rqgaZQSPX0pxm6iOPJa0NtBaT8haF6TFhwgYrg&oe=6A05CB2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore